  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Treetop Song (first time played live)** (1 other source): This was the first time the song was played live [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ox Baker Triumphant**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Steps Columns Pillars**: rare: 3 archived performances; with JV [3]\n- **Sudden Oak Death**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with JV [3]\n- **Surrounded**: rare: 14 archived performances; with JV [3]\n- **See America Right**: with JV [3]\n- **Treetop Song (first time played live)**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Cutter**: back after 126 archived shows (4316 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2009-04-09** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 73 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording is described as excellent with a quiet audience [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: JV [1]\n- John Darnielle told hilarious stories between songs, a rare occurrence [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2009-04-09**: taped by Craig/Gnat; transferred by Craig/Gnat; source: Matched Pair AT2021s 8ft Stand FOB center -> Denecke Dcode PS-2 -> Edirol R-09 [1]",
